        "Associated with hyperlipidemia",
        "Lesions are more transient and eruptive",
        "No mucosal involvement"
      ]
    },
    {
      "diseaseId": "juvenile-xanthogranuloma",
      "distinguishingFeatures": [
        "Usually solitary or few lesions",
        "Primarily affects infants and young children",
        "Lacks mucosal and systemic involvement"
      ]
    },
    {
      "diseaseId": "necrobiotic-xanthogranuloma",
      "distinguishingFeatures": [
